// ✅ OBV trend detection
// ✅ 6 Candlestick pattern recognition
// ✅ Pivot-based Support/Resistance
// ✅ RSI/Price Divergence detection
// ✅ Support-based Stop Loss (hybrid ATR + swing + S/R)
// ✅ Score breakdown in table (T/R/V/M/P/Pat)
// ✅ Separated thresholds (BUY=70, ACC=55, HOLD=40)
// ✅ Removed dead code and fixed double counting
